<title>CANADA: Shaw says pager unit no longer for sale.</title>
<headline>Shaw says pager unit no longer for sale.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shaw Communications Inc said on Friday it has decided not to sell its pager unit, SHAW MobileComm, due to a lack of good offers.</p>
<p>Shaw said while indications looked good in the summer of 1996 on a possible sale of the unit, there have been &quot;dramatic declines&quot; in the valuations of pager operations, particularly in the United States.</p>
<p>Shaw said the unit, however, continues to add subscribers and has a positive cash flow.</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto bureau 416-941-8100))</p>
</text>
